WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.001 --> 00:00:02.919
BLEACH EPISODE 45

2
00:00:05.630 --> 00:00:09.676
Getsuga Tensho fused with Gran Rey Cero.

3
00:00:09.759 --> 00:00:13.179
Born from the fusion of all things,

4
00:00:13.263 --> 00:00:15.223
you are well-suited to this power.

5
00:00:16.182 --> 00:00:17.350
But...

6
00:00:17.434 --> 00:00:21.396
And yet... It still falls short!

7
00:00:35.035 --> 00:00:37.954
DEFEND YOU

8
00:02:05.625 --> 00:02:07.919
BLEACH: THOUSAND-YEAR BLOOD WAR

9
00:02:09.712 --> 00:02:12.590
Brazo Izquierdo Del Diablo.

10
00:02:13.174 --> 00:02:14.467
La Muerte!

11
00:02:16.553 --> 00:02:18.263
Great!

12
00:02:18.346 --> 00:02:20.932
Keep this up and defeat the rest of them!

13
00:02:32.026 --> 00:02:33.403
What the heck?

14
00:02:33.486 --> 00:02:35.905
- It's just you two?
- Where's Ichigo?

15
00:02:35.989 --> 00:02:38.366
He and Inoue went after Yhwach.

16
00:02:39.200 --> 00:02:40.118
Geez.

17
00:02:40.201 --> 00:02:42.745
At least he didn't just charge off alone.

18
00:02:44.122 --> 00:02:46.332
- Renji...
- Rukia, you go on ahead.

19
00:02:46.416 --> 00:02:48.042
I'll handle things here.

20
00:02:49.002 --> 00:02:49.919
Alright.

21
00:02:57.468 --> 00:02:59.178
You don't seem to get it yet.

22
00:02:59.762 --> 00:03:04.058
All of you are just stepping stones to me.

23
00:03:12.483 --> 00:03:14.694
Uryu Ishida, is running away
all you can do?

24
00:03:32.253 --> 00:03:36.633
Come on, nock your arrows,
the last Quincy.

25
00:03:37.508 --> 00:03:39.385
I will cut down your arrows

26
00:03:40.428 --> 00:03:43.139
and expose everything about you.

27
00:03:48.061 --> 00:03:51.940
Bring it on, if your sword can reach me.

28
00:04:06.329 --> 00:04:09.540
An unparalleled vortex of chaos.

29
00:04:09.624 --> 00:04:11.209
This is

30
00:04:12.335 --> 00:04:14.170
the power of the Soul King.

31
00:04:17.423 --> 00:04:19.092
You can't stop it.

32
00:04:22.470 --> 00:04:23.846
Shitenkoshun!

33
00:04:37.360 --> 00:04:40.989
Ichigo, what is power?

34
00:04:41.072 --> 00:04:43.283
What does it exist for?

35
00:04:43.366 --> 00:04:47.036
You'd probably say, "to defend," right?

36
00:04:48.246 --> 00:04:52.292
But that is a weak power.

37
00:04:56.629 --> 00:04:59.674
True power is the one
that crushes everyone,

38
00:04:59.757 --> 00:05:01.884
makes the world bow down,

39
00:05:01.968 --> 00:05:05.138
and takes everything
in this world in hand.

40
00:05:05.805 --> 00:05:08.891
Since you say you'll defeat me,

41
00:05:09.642 --> 00:05:13.021
your power should be like this.

42
00:05:13.604 --> 00:05:15.732
"To defend" is nothing but a lie.

43
00:05:15.815 --> 00:05:17.275
Stop playing the hero,

44
00:05:17.984 --> 00:05:18.901
Ichigo.

45
00:05:19.527 --> 00:05:20.653
<i>To defend...</i>

46
00:05:22.113 --> 00:05:25.616
<i>I was trying to defend Kurosaki.</i>

47
00:05:27.618 --> 00:05:29.746
<i>But my power is simply too weak.</i>

48
00:05:31.164 --> 00:05:34.375
<i>If only my power were stronger...</i>

49
00:05:50.391 --> 00:05:51.809
A mere trifle.

50
00:05:52.685 --> 00:05:54.103
I reject!

51
00:06:01.736 --> 00:06:03.154
Reject!

52
00:06:15.291 --> 00:06:16.209
Inoue!

53
00:06:17.335 --> 00:06:21.089
Can you afford
to worry about someone else?

54
00:06:34.268 --> 00:06:37.063
Fine, keep it up.

55
00:06:37.980 --> 00:06:40.733
Until your power is exhausted.

56
00:06:46.989 --> 00:06:51.202
I reject.

57
00:07:06.092 --> 00:07:07.844
Inoue...

58
00:07:09.262 --> 00:07:11.222
S... stop.

59
00:07:12.515 --> 00:07:17.228
I reject.

60
00:07:27.947 --> 00:07:29.907
- Enough, Inoue!
- Shut up.

61
00:07:29.991 --> 00:07:31.826
I reject!

62
00:07:39.208 --> 00:07:43.087
Did you exhaust your power on Ichigo?

63
00:07:46.716 --> 00:07:50.219
But so what?

64
00:07:52.847 --> 00:07:54.140
<i>If only my power</i>

65
00:07:57.435 --> 00:08:00.688
<i>were stronger...</i>

66
00:08:07.028 --> 00:08:10.656
You did well to hold on this long, Inoue.

67
00:08:11.157 --> 00:08:13.159
Kuchiki.

68
00:08:14.243 --> 00:08:15.119
Rukia?

69
00:08:16.162 --> 00:08:18.873
Ichigo, I'm here to save you.

70
00:08:23.586 --> 00:08:25.963
Inoue, are you alright?

71
00:08:26.047 --> 00:08:26.964
Yeah.

72
00:08:27.048 --> 00:08:29.300
Thank you for saving me.

73
00:08:30.343 --> 00:08:32.136
Leave the rest to me.

74
00:08:38.893 --> 00:08:41.729
It's been a while,
and you've changed quite a bit.

75
00:08:42.522 --> 00:08:44.315
Wrapped up like a mummy
in a black blanket,

76
00:08:44.398 --> 00:08:45.983
and you've even grown a horn.

77
00:08:46.067 --> 00:08:46.901
Shut up.

78
00:08:46.984 --> 00:08:48.903
I didn't ask to get wrapped up.

79
00:08:48.986 --> 00:08:50.488
And the horn is cool, okay?

80
00:08:50.571 --> 00:08:51.489
And what's your deal?

81
00:08:51.572 --> 00:08:52.990
Don't just show up and start criticizing.

82
00:08:53.074 --> 00:08:54.075
What did you say?

83
00:08:54.158 --> 00:08:56.244
Is that how you talk to someone
who came to save you?

84
00:08:56.327 --> 00:08:57.578
I didn't ask you to save me.

85
00:08:57.662 --> 00:09:00.414
How could you even say that after being
wrapped like a mummy and beaten hard!

86
00:09:00.498 --> 00:09:03.668
I was just about to counterattack!

87
00:09:07.171 --> 00:09:09.465
Looks like you haven't backed down.

88
00:09:09.966 --> 00:09:11.300
Of course not.

89
00:09:11.384 --> 00:09:13.344
Rukia Kuchiki,

90
00:09:13.427 --> 00:09:17.265
the Soul Reaper who guided Ichigo?

91
00:09:18.849 --> 00:09:23.187
If I had to thank a Soul Reaper,
it would be you.

92
00:09:23.271 --> 00:09:26.774
You're the one
who triggered Ichigo's awakening.

93
00:09:27.692 --> 00:09:30.778
Then I don't need to apologize
for my rudeness.

94
00:09:32.154 --> 00:09:35.783
The ones who will defeat you
will also be me and him.

95
00:09:39.745 --> 00:09:42.248
- Rukia, let's go.
- Okay.

96
00:09:44.959 --> 00:09:45.835
What's wrong?

97
00:09:45.918 --> 00:09:47.712
Nothing new here.

98
00:09:53.634 --> 00:09:54.468
<i>One.</i>

99
00:09:55.136 --> 00:09:56.554
<i>Two.</i>

100
00:09:58.598 --> 00:10:00.016
<i>Three.</i>

101
00:10:00.099 --> 00:10:01.225
I see it.

102
00:10:03.728 --> 00:10:06.689
The last Quincy is sneaking up
on someone with a sword.

103
00:10:06.772 --> 00:10:08.274
It's an arrow.

104
00:10:08.357 --> 00:10:10.651
Try predicting what I'm about to say too.

105
00:10:10.735 --> 00:10:12.278
Grand Master!

106
00:10:14.447 --> 00:10:16.282
If there is a next time.

107
00:10:25.416 --> 00:10:27.168
What a pitiful sight.

108
00:10:27.877 --> 00:10:31.881
But it suits you well, Uryu Ishida.

109
00:10:52.777 --> 00:10:54.987
A fascinating power.

110
00:10:55.071 --> 00:10:59.200
But fighting alongside your companions
has become a shackle instead.

111
00:10:59.700 --> 00:11:01.619
Rukia, we need to go faster

112
00:11:02.411 --> 00:11:03.954
and defeat that guy.

113
00:11:04.622 --> 00:11:06.374
You don't have to tell me.

114
00:11:49.083 --> 00:11:52.753
<i>If only I had the power,</i>

115
00:11:53.712 --> 00:11:59.635
<i>Kurosaki and Kuchiki
wouldn't have gotten hurt so badly.</i>

116
00:12:00.761 --> 00:12:02.888
<i>It's all because my power is too weak.</i>

117
00:12:04.014 --> 00:12:08.269
<i>That's why Kurosaki and Kuchiki
are suffering.</i>

118
00:12:09.895 --> 00:12:13.899
<i>If only my power could become</i>

119
00:12:14.817 --> 00:12:15.901
<i>stronger.</i>

120
00:12:30.207 --> 00:12:34.837
Return to nothing, you weaklings.

121
00:12:44.889 --> 00:12:48.350
Farewell, my son.

122
00:13:02.072 --> 00:13:04.909
It's the moon.

123
00:13:05.826 --> 00:13:06.994
Ban...

124
00:13:11.874 --> 00:13:12.875
kai.

125
00:13:20.007 --> 00:13:22.176
So you're finally showing it?

126
00:13:23.135 --> 00:13:25.804
Your Bankai.

127
00:13:43.155 --> 00:13:44.615
Kurosaki.

128
00:13:44.698 --> 00:13:45.533
I see.

129
00:13:46.200 --> 00:13:48.661
So that is your Zangetsu.

130
00:13:56.085 --> 00:13:58.921
For all the power you possess,

131
00:13:59.755 --> 00:14:02.174
I will make it submit.

132
00:14:13.310 --> 00:14:14.853
This power

133
00:14:15.896 --> 00:14:19.275
is needed to protect everyone

134
00:14:20.276 --> 00:14:22.027
from you.

135
00:14:23.737 --> 00:14:25.614
Ichigo, you're too weak.

136
00:14:25.698 --> 00:14:28.200
Yhwach, here I come.

137
00:14:34.415 --> 00:14:37.376
<i>What? My slash got slower?</i>

138
00:14:38.043 --> 00:14:41.046
<i>But it's fine. I just need to wield it.</i>

139
00:14:44.008 --> 00:14:46.176
I definitely felt like I cut him.

140
00:14:46.260 --> 00:14:47.887
Why are you still there?

141
00:14:54.852 --> 00:14:55.811
What?

142
00:15:01.609 --> 00:15:04.153
Detestable Spiritual Pressure!

143
00:15:37.603 --> 00:15:40.773
So this is the power
that transcends Soul Reapers.

144
00:15:40.856 --> 00:15:44.360
But I told you, you're too weak, Ichigo.

145
00:15:52.242 --> 00:15:55.829
It feels as if the power is saying
it doesn't need companions.

146
00:16:09.468 --> 00:16:10.469
Getsuga

147
00:16:19.728 --> 00:16:24.066
Tensho!

148
00:16:44.795 --> 00:16:45.963
Kurosaki.

149
00:17:04.898 --> 00:17:06.734
"He's underestimating me."

150
00:17:07.776 --> 00:17:10.154
"I'll defeat him in this instant."

151
00:17:10.237 --> 00:17:12.114
That's what you were thinking, right?

152
00:17:13.407 --> 00:17:16.076
I'm not underestimating you.

153
00:17:16.160 --> 00:17:19.329
To consume you,
I must first know about you.

154
00:17:19.413 --> 00:17:21.540
Ichigo, slash now! Right now!

155
00:17:21.623 --> 00:17:23.876
And then, at that moment...

156
00:17:23.959 --> 00:17:24.835
Getsuga!

157
00:17:25.419 --> 00:17:27.755
It's over now!

158
00:17:36.138 --> 00:17:37.056
Kurosaki.

159
00:17:43.187 --> 00:17:45.189
You are the final onlooker.

160
00:17:46.065 --> 00:17:49.318
I'll make you watch yourself
vanish from this world,

161
00:17:49.401 --> 00:17:50.694
unable to protect anything,

162
00:17:50.778 --> 00:17:52.154
leave nothing behind,

163
00:17:52.237 --> 00:17:53.739
unable to do anything,

164
00:17:53.822 --> 00:17:55.324
and end up being annihilated.

165
00:17:56.366 --> 00:18:00.829
I will protect Kurosaki.

166
00:18:00.913 --> 00:18:04.291
Your unwavering will is commendable,

167
00:18:04.374 --> 00:18:08.962
but with your power,
let alone protecting Ichigo,

168
00:18:09.046 --> 00:18:12.216
you are far from even qualified
to fight alongside him.

169
00:18:12.299 --> 00:18:14.343
The reason you are here

170
00:18:14.426 --> 00:18:17.304
is because Ichigo is too immature
to let go of his naivety.

171
00:18:17.387 --> 00:18:18.764
Yhwach!

172
00:18:27.272 --> 00:18:31.151
That woman has always been your weakness.

173
00:18:31.777 --> 00:18:35.239
What hinders you from fighting

174
00:18:35.322 --> 00:18:38.242
is precisely the reason
you hold your sword,

175
00:18:38.325 --> 00:18:40.202
which is your heartfelt desire to protect.

176
00:18:41.620 --> 00:18:45.415
It is because you fight
that you will be defeated.

177
00:18:46.375 --> 00:18:47.501
Ichigo.

178
00:19:12.943 --> 00:19:13.986
Bankai.

179
00:19:19.658 --> 00:19:21.201
Hakka no Togame.

180
00:19:27.749 --> 00:19:28.792
Getsuga

181
00:19:28.876 --> 00:19:31.044
Tensho!

182
00:20:05.287 --> 00:20:06.663
Kuchiki.

183
00:20:11.043 --> 00:20:13.212
This is true power.

184
00:20:14.421 --> 00:20:16.673
You are too foolish,

185
00:20:18.926 --> 00:20:20.344
Ichigo.

186
00:20:22.304 --> 00:20:26.725
This is the outcome of the protective
power you were talking about.

187
00:20:27.559 --> 00:20:33.482
And this is the proof
of the mighty power I spoke of.

188
00:20:34.900 --> 00:20:36.777
<i>If only my power</i>

189
00:20:37.903 --> 00:20:43.742
<i>could become stronger...</i>

190
00:20:49.957 --> 00:20:53.335
Be reduced to ashes, Uryu Ishida.

191
00:20:56.505 --> 00:20:58.924
Just as I expected, Uryu Ishida.

192
00:20:59.007 --> 00:21:00.300
Your trump card,

193
00:21:01.468 --> 00:21:03.303
the Leiden Hant.

194
00:21:03.387 --> 00:21:06.473
Come on, I've seen through
your next move too.

195
00:21:07.224 --> 00:21:10.269
You'd better not use
His Majesty Yhwach's power

196
00:21:10.352 --> 00:21:13.313
without restraint.

197
00:21:14.189 --> 00:21:15.524
It'll leave you open.

198
00:21:15.607 --> 00:21:16.984
Open?

199
00:21:17.734 --> 00:21:22.322
Are you saying that because
you've already gotten behind me?

200
00:21:26.368 --> 00:21:27.786
Shuno.

201
00:21:33.333 --> 00:21:34.584
Tsubaki.

202
00:21:37.087 --> 00:21:38.255
Ayame.

203
00:21:39.214 --> 00:21:40.382
Hinagiku.

204
00:21:43.927 --> 00:21:44.970
Baigon.

205
00:21:45.595 --> 00:21:46.722
Lily.

206
00:22:05.282 --> 00:22:07.701
<i>Why am I so weak?</i>

207
00:22:10.287 --> 00:22:13.582
<i>Why is my power so small?</i>

208
00:22:18.837 --> 00:22:20.172
Sternstaup!

209
00:22:21.006 --> 00:22:22.341
I see it.

210
00:22:26.344 --> 00:22:28.221
- Darn it!
- Three seconds.

211
00:22:28.305 --> 00:22:31.099
If I look like I'm running around,

212
00:22:31.183 --> 00:22:33.268
that's the reason for your defeat.

213
00:22:33.351 --> 00:22:35.520
Once you use the Almighty,

214
00:22:35.604 --> 00:22:37.689
you can't use that power again
within three seconds.

215
00:22:38.315 --> 00:22:41.276
A mere three seconds
could never give you a chance to win.

216
00:22:44.029 --> 00:22:45.906
But I still got three seconds.

217
00:22:53.371 --> 00:22:56.124
<i>If my power</i>

218
00:22:57.292 --> 00:23:00.504
<i>were stronger than it is now,</i>

219
00:23:02.631 --> 00:23:05.008
<i>so strong that even I couldn't bear it,</i>

220
00:23:05.967 --> 00:23:08.220
<i>so vast and boundless...</i>

221
00:23:13.225 --> 00:23:16.436
<i>If it could just envelop the entire world,</i>

222
00:23:16.937 --> 00:23:23.819
<i>it would eliminate fighting, injury, pain,</i>

223
00:23:24.319 --> 00:23:26.696
<i>and everything.</i>

224
00:23:40.210 --> 00:23:43.839
<i>So I...</i>

225
00:23:44.548 --> 00:23:48.593
Are you sacrificing yourself,
Orihime Inoue?

226
00:23:58.186 --> 00:23:59.354
This thing...

227
00:23:59.437 --> 00:24:03.150
With this thing,
I can make your power disappear.

228
00:24:14.244 --> 00:24:15.245
Wait.

229
00:24:17.455 --> 00:24:18.415
Inoue!

230
00:24:18.999 --> 00:24:21.293
Inoue...

231
00:25:08.465 --> 00:25:10.508
BLEACH EPISODE 45

232
00:25:10.592 --> 00:25:12.802
<i>Bye-bye, Kurosaki.</i>

233
00:25:13.303 --> 00:25:16.431
<i>I'll block it all for you.</i>

234
00:25:16.514 --> 00:25:17.766
DEFEND YOU

235
00:25:17.849 --> 00:25:20.894
LIFE TO DEFEND YOU

